```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization members update --help
Update an organization member's role

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization members update [OPTIONS] --role <ROLE> <ORGANIZATION> <MEMBERSHIP>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <MEMBERSHIP>    Exact membership ID

Options:
      --role <ROLE>          Set the organization role [possible values: owner, member]
      --json                 Print the organization result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
